{%- comment -%}
  nova-money.liquid

  Renders a price with a real currency symbol.

  The shop's money format is still "{{amount}} NIS", which prints "130.18 NIS"
  instead of "₪130.18". That setting lives in Settings > General and has no
  Admin API, so until it is changed by hand this snippet puts the correct symbol
  on the product page rather than waiting.

  Pass `symbol` blank to fall back to the shop's own format.

  Usage: {% render 'nova-money', cents: variant.price, symbol: '₪' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if symbol != blank -%}
  {{- symbol }}{{ cents | money_without_currency -}}
{%- else -%}
  {{- cents | money -}}
{%- endif -%}
